{"id":68304,"date":"2022-02-22T15:48:00","date_gmt":"2022-02-22T14:48:00","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=68304"},"modified":"2026-10-01T22:48:35","modified_gmt":"2026-10-01T21:48:35","slug":"corrida-do-bombeiro","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/corrida-do-bombeiro\/","title":{"rendered":"8\u00aa Generali Tranquilidade Corrida do Bombeiro 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style>\n<p><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">8\u00aa Generali Tranquilidade Corrida do Bombeiro 2026<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O <strong>8\u00aa Generali Tranquilidade Corrida do Bombeiro 2026<\/strong> realiza-se no dia <strong>18 de Outubro de 2026<\/strong> (Domingo), com partida agendada para as <strong>09:00<\/strong> em <strong>Miramar, Vila Nova de Gaia<\/strong>, no concelho de <strong>Vila Nova de Gaia<\/strong>, distrito de <strong>Porto<\/strong>. Esta conceituada competi\u00e7\u00e3o desportiva re\u00fane praticantes e entusiastas de corrida num ambiente de celebra\u00e7\u00e3o atl\u00e9tica e conv\u00edvio popular.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O programa do evento contempla percursos oficiais nas dist\u00e2ncias de <strong>10 km e 5 km<\/strong>, tra\u00e7ados em asfalto e pavimento urbano com total apoio t\u00e9cnico. A organiza\u00e7\u00e3o disponibiliza postos de abastecimento regulares, cronometragem eletr\u00f3nica de tempos, assist\u00eancia m\u00e9dica, seguran\u00e7a vi\u00e1ria e medalha exclusiva de participa\u00e7\u00e3o a todos os finalistas.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">A realiza\u00e7\u00e3o est\u00e1 a cargo de <strong>Eventsport<\/strong>, com o compromisso de assegurar uma experi\u00eancia desportiva segura, rigorosa e festiva para todos os atletas, caminheiros e acompanhantes presentes.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2>\n<ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\">\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data &#038; Hor\u00e1rio<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weigh